# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Bench reports ARE tracked. They are machine-written rather than source, but
# they are also the only evidence behind every performance claim this project
# makes — the README points at them, and an ignored report directory would mean
# those numbers had nothing committed to back them. They are small, immutable,
# and carry their own git SHA, so they read as a permanent measurement log.
# Only stray non-report files are excluded.
bench/report/*
!bench/report/.gitkeep
!bench/report/*.json

# Docker
*.log
